On Wednesday, October 22, 2014 12:21:13 PM UTC+2, Ed wrote:
> Hi everyone,
>
> I'm using the functions renderTable and tableOutput to display a data frame that changes depending on the input parameter.
>
>
> source("isDeGene.R")
